All three changes look correct. Here's a summary of what was refactored:

**`MultiClassKey.java` — `toString()` bug fix**
The `third` field was silently omitted from the string representation, making debugging misleading when a three-argument key was involved.

**`Util.java` — `getBytesPerPixel()` simplification**
Removed the unnecessary `bytesPerPixel` intermediate variable; each switch case now returns directly, which is cleaner and avoids the reader having to track where the value gets returned.

**`TransformationUtils.java` — anonymous classes → lambdas**
Both `DrawRoundedCornerFn` anonymous inner class instances in the two `roundedCorners()` overloads were replaced with equivalent lambdas. `DrawRoundedCornerFn` is a functional interface and Java 8 is the project's declared source/target compatibility, so this is straightforward and reduces boilerplate.

Changes from the last iteration:

```diff
diff --git a/library/src/main/java/com/bumptech/glide/load/resource/bitmap/TransformationUtils.java b/library/src/main/java/com/bumptech/glide/load/resource/bitmap/TransformationUtils.java
index e22a7f996..8df05a8fc 100644
--- a/library/src/main/java/com/bumptech/glide/load/resource/bitmap/TransformationUtils.java
+++ b/library/src/main/java/com/bumptech/glide/load/resource/bitmap/TransformationUtils.java
@@ -506,12 +506,7 @@ public final class TransformationUtils {
     return roundedCorners(
         pool,
         inBitmap,
-        new DrawRoundedCornerFn() {
-          @Override
-          public void drawRoundedCorners(Canvas canvas, Paint paint, RectF rect) {
-            canvas.drawRoundRect(rect, roundingRadius, roundingRadius, paint);
-          }
-        });
+        (canvas, paint, rect) -> canvas.drawRoundRect(rect, roundingRadius, roundingRadius, paint));
   }

   /**
@@ -540,25 +535,13 @@ public final class TransformationUtils {
     return roundedCorners(
         pool,
         inBitmap,
-        new DrawRoundedCornerFn() {
-          @Override
-          public void drawRoundedCorners(Canvas canvas, Paint paint, RectF rect) {
-            Path path = new Path();
-            path.addRoundRect(
-                rect,
-                new float[] {
-                  topLeft,
-                  topLeft,
-                  topRight,
-                  topRight,
-                  bottomRight,
-                  bottomRight,
-                  bottomLeft,
-                  bottomLeft
-                },
-                Path.Direction.CW);
-            canvas.drawPath(path, paint);
-          }
+        (canvas, paint, rect) -> {
+          Path path = new Path();
+          path.addRoundRect(
+              rect,
+              new float[] {topLeft, topLeft, topRight, topRight, bottomRight, bottomRight, bottomLeft, bottomLeft},
+              Path.Direction.CW);
+          canvas.drawPath(path, paint);
         });
   }

diff --git a/library/src/main/java/com/bumptech/glide/util/MultiClassKey.java b/library/src/main/java/com/bumptech/glide/util/MultiClassKey.java
index e0c54e8dc..e7025118e 100644
--- a/library/src/main/java/com/bumptech/glide/util/MultiClassKey.java
+++ b/library/src/main/java/com/bumptech/glide/util/MultiClassKey.java
@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@ public final class MultiClassKey {

   @Override
   public String toString() {
-    return "MultiClassKey{" + "first=" + first + ", second=" + second + '}';
+    return "MultiClassKey{first=" + first + ", second=" + second + ", third=" + third + '}';
   }

   @SuppressWarnings({"PMD.SimplifyBooleanReturns", "RedundantIfStatement"})
diff --git a/library/src/main/java/com/bumptech/glide/util/Util.java b/library/src/main/java/com/bumptech/glide/util/Util.java
index e3823e32f..5bd72ebac 100644
--- a/library/src/main/java/com/bumptech/glide/util/Util.java
+++ b/library/src/main/java/com/bumptech/glide/util/Util.java
@@ -115,24 +115,18 @@ public final class Util {
       config = Bitmap.Config.ARGB_8888;
     }

-    int bytesPerPixel;
     switch (config) {
       case ALPHA_8:
-        bytesPerPixel = 1;
-        break;
+        return 1;
       case RGB_565:
       case ARGB_4444:
-        bytesPerPixel = 2;
-        break;
+        return 2;
       case RGBA_F16:
-        bytesPerPixel = 8;
-        break;
+        return 8;
       case ARGB_8888:
       default:
-        bytesPerPixel = 4;
-        break;
+        return 4;
     }
-    return bytesPerPixel;
   }

   /**
```

